#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mid-circuit measurements {#mid-circuit-measurements}"
msgstr "Ukuran pertengahan litar {#mid-circuit-measurements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prior to `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.43.0, `measure` was the only measurement instruction in Qiskit. Mid-circuit measurements, however, have different tuning requirements than _terminal_ measurements (measurements that happen at the end of a circuit). For example, you need to consider the instruction duration when tuning a mid-circuit measurement because longer instructions cause noisier circuits. You don't need to consider instruction duration for terminal measurements because there are no instructions after terminal measurements.\n"
msgstr "Sebelum `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.43.0, `measure` adalah satu-satunya arahan ukuran dalam Qiskit. Walau bagaimanapun, ukuran pertengahan litar mempunyai keperluan penalaan yang berbeza daripada ukuran _terminal_ (ukuran yang berlaku di penghujung litar). Sebagai contoh, anda perlu mempertimbangkan tempoh arahan apabila menala ukuran pertengahan litar kerana arahan yang lebih lama menyebabkan litar yang lebih berhingar. Anda tidak perlu mempertimbangkan tempoh arahan untuk ukuran terminal kerana tiada arahan selepas ukuran terminal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The `MidCircuitMeasure` instruction maps to the `measure_2` instruction reported in the backend's `supported_instructions`. However,  `measure_2` is not supported on all backends. Use `service.backends(filters=lambda b: \"measure_2\" in b.supported_instructions)` to find backends that support it.  New measurements might be added in the future, but this is not guarenteed.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Arahan `MidCircuitMeasure` dipetakan kepada arahan `measure_2` yang dilaporkan dalam `supported_instructions` Backend. Walau bagaimanapun, `measure_2` tidak disokong pada semua Backend. Gunakan `service.backends(filters=lambda b: \"measure_2\" in b.supported_instructions)` untuk mencari Backend yang menyokongnya. Ukuran baru mungkin ditambahkan pada masa depan, tetapi ini tidak dijamin.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "`MidCircuitMeasure` method {#midcircuitmeasure-method}"
msgstr "Kaedah `MidCircuitMeasure` {#midcircuitmeasure-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.43.0, the `MidCircuitMeasure` instruction was introduced. As the name suggests, it is a new measurement instruction that is optimized for mid-circuit on IBM&reg; QPUs.  While you can use `QuantumCircuit.measure` for a mid-circuit measurement, because of its design, `MidCircuitMeasure` is typically a better choice.  For example, it adds less overhead to your circuit than when using `QuantumCircuit.measure`.\n"
msgstr "Dalam `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.43.0, arahan `MidCircuitMeasure` telah diperkenalkan. Seperti namanya, ia adalah arahan ukuran baru yang dioptimumkan untuk pertengahan litar pada QPU IBM&reg;. Walaupun anda boleh menggunakan `QuantumCircuit.measure` untuk ukuran pertengahan litar, kerana reka bentuknya, `MidCircuitMeasure` biasanya merupakan pilihan yang lebih baik. Sebagai contoh, ia menambahkan lebih sedikit overhed kepada litar anda berbanding menggunakan `QuantumCircuit.measure`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"warning\" title=\"Important notes\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"warning\" title=\"Nota penting\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "There must be at least one classical register in order to use measurements.\n"
msgstr "Mesti ada sekurang-kurangnya satu daftar klasikal untuk menggunakan ukuran.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Sampler primitive requires circuit measurements. You can add circuit measurements with the Estimator primitive, but they are ignored.\n"
msgstr "Primitif Sampler memerlukan ukuran litar. Anda boleh menambah ukuran litar dengan primitif Estimator, tetapi ia diabaikan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Store` {#store}"
msgstr "`Store` {#store}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With `qiskit-ibm-runtime` version 0.47.0 or later, you can use the [`store`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) instruction to save the result of a classical expression, if that expression will be used repeatedly. Operations are automatically parallelized, making your code significantly more efficient at runtime.\n"
msgstr "Dengan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` versi 0.47.0 atau lebih baru, anda boleh menggunakan arahan [`store`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) untuk menyimpan hasil ungkapan klasikal, jika ungkapan tersebut akan digunakan berulang kali. Operasi diparalelkan secara automatik, menjadikan kod anda jauh lebih cekap semasa masa jalan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information, see the [Classical feedforward and control flow](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow#store) guide.\n"
msgstr "Untuk maklumat lanjut, lihat panduan [Suapan balik klasikal dan aliran kawalan](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow#store).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you use `store` to save a value to a classical register on a real backend, that value is only saved in memory during execution and not copied or returned in the job result.\n"
msgstr "Apabila anda menggunakan `store` untuk menyimpan nilai ke daftar klasikal pada Backend sebenar, nilai tersebut hanya disimpan dalam memori semasa pelaksanaan dan tidak disalin atau dikembalikan dalam keputusan kerja.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For example, in the following code, `temp` has the same value as `creg` during execution, and the `if_test` works as expected. But after the job finishes, the `temp` BitArray returned in the job result **does not** contain the value of `creg`.  That is, `job.result()[0].data.temp` is `0`.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai contoh, dalam kod berikut, `temp` mempunyai nilai yang sama dengan `creg` semasa pelaksanaan, dan `if_test` berfungsi seperti yang dijangkakan. Tetapi selepas kerja selesai, `temp` BitArray yang dikembalikan dalam keputusan kerja **tidak** mengandungi nilai `creg`. Iaitu, `job.result()[0].data.temp` adalah `0`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full example {#full-example}"
msgstr "Contoh penuh {#full-example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following code creates and runs a dynamic circuit on IBM&reg; hardware.\n"
msgstr "Kod berikut mencipta dan menjalankan litar dinamik pada perkakasan IBM&reg;.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum Compute limitations {#quantum-compute-limitations}"
msgstr "Had Quantum Compute {#quantum-compute-limitations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Be aware of the following constraints when running dynamic circuits in Quantum Compute.\n"
msgstr "Sedar tentang kekangan berikut apabila menjalankan litar dinamik dalam Quantum Compute.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Due to the limited physical memory on control electronics, there is also a limit on the number of `if` statements and size of their operands. This limit is a function of the number of broadcasts and the number of broadcasted bits in a job (not a circuit).\n"
msgstr "Disebabkan memori fizikal yang terhad pada elektronik kawalan, terdapat juga had pada bilangan pernyataan `if` dan saiz operannya. Had ini adalah fungsi bilangan siaran dan bilangan bit yang disiarkan dalam kerja (bukan litar).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   When processing an `if` condition, measurement data needs to be transferred to the control logic to make that evaluation. A broadcast is a transfer of unique classical data, and broadcasted bits is the number of classical bits being transferred. Consider the following:\n"
msgstr "   Apabila memproses syarat `if`, data ukuran perlu dipindahkan kepada logik kawalan untuk membuat penilaian tersebut. Siaran adalah pemindahan data klasikal yang unik, dan bit yang disiarkan adalah bilangan bit klasikal yang dipindahkan. Pertimbangkan yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   In the previous code example, the first two `if_test` objects on `c0` are considered one broadcast because the content of `c0` did not change, and thus does not need to be re-broadcasted. The `if_test` on `c1` is a second broadcast. The first one broadcasts all three bits in `c0` and the second broadcasts just one bit, making a total of four broadcasted bits.\n"
msgstr "   Dalam contoh kod sebelumnya, dua objek `if_test` pertama pada `c0` dianggap satu siaran kerana kandungan `c0` tidak berubah, dan oleh itu tidak perlu disiarkan semula. `if_test` pada `c1` adalah siaran kedua. Yang pertama menyiarkan semua tiga bit dalam `c0` dan yang kedua menyiarkan hanya satu bit, menjadikan jumlah empat bit yang disiarkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   Currently, if you broadcast 60 bits each time, then the job can have approximately 300 broadcasts. If you broadcast just one bit each time, however, then the job can have 2400 broadcasts.\n"
msgstr "   Kini, jika anda menyiarkan 60 bit setiap kali, maka kerja boleh mempunyai kira-kira 300 siaran. Walau bagaimanapun, jika anda hanya menyiarkan satu bit setiap kali, maka kerja boleh mempunyai 2400 siaran.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The operand used in an `if_test` statement must be 32 or fewer bits. Thus, if you are comparing an entire `ClassicalRegister`, the size of that `ClassicalRegister` must be 32 or fewer bits. If you are comparing just a single bit from a `ClassicalRegister`, however, that `ClassicalRegister` can be of any size (since the operand is only one bit).\n"
msgstr "Operan yang digunakan dalam pernyataan `if_test` mestilah 32 bit atau kurang. Oleh itu, jika anda membandingkan keseluruhan `ClassicalRegister`, saiz `ClassicalRegister` tersebut mestilah 32 bit atau kurang. Walau bagaimanapun, jika anda hanya membandingkan satu bit dari `ClassicalRegister`, `ClassicalRegister` tersebut boleh berukuran apa-apa (kerana operannya hanya satu bit).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   For example, the \"Not valid\" code block does not work because `cr` is more than 32 bits.  You can, however, use a classical register wider than 32 bits if you are testing only one bit, as shown in the \"Valid\" code block.\n"
msgstr "   Sebagai contoh, blok kod \"Tidak sah\" tidak berfungsi kerana `cr` mempunyai lebih daripada 32 bit. Walau bagaimanapun, anda boleh menggunakan daftar klasikal yang lebih lebar daripada 32 bit jika anda menguji hanya satu bit, seperti yang ditunjukkan dalam blok kod \"Sah\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   <Tabs>\n"
"   <TabItem value=\"Not valid\" label=\"Not valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"   <Tabs>\n"
"   <TabItem value=\"Not valid\" label=\"Tidak sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```python\n"
"         cr = ClassicalRegister(50)\n"
"         qr = QuantumRegister(50)\n"
"         circuit = QuantumCircuit(qr, cr)\n"
"         ...\n"
"         circ.measure(qr, cr)\n"
"         with circ.if_test((cr, 15)):\n"
"            ...\n"
"      ```\n"
"   </TabItem>\n"
"   <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```python\n"
"         cr = ClassicalRegister(50)\n"
"         qr = QuantumRegister(50)\n"
"         circuit = QuantumCircuit(qr, cr)\n"
"         ...\n"
"         circ.measure(qr, cr)\n"
"         with circ.if_test((cr, 15)):\n"
"            ...\n"
"      ```\n"
"   </TabItem>\n"
"   <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```python\n"
"         cr = ClassicalRegister(50)\n"
"         qr = QuantumRegister(50)\n"
"         circuit = QuantumCircuit(qr, cr)\n"
"         ...\n"
"         circ.measure(qr, cr)\n"
"         with circ.if_test((cr[5], 1)):\n"
"            ...\n"
"      ```\n"
"   </TabItem>\n"
"   </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```python\n"
"         cr = ClassicalRegister(50)\n"
"         qr = QuantumRegister(50)\n"
"         circuit = QuantumCircuit(qr, cr)\n"
"         ...\n"
"         circ.measure(qr, cr)\n"
"         with circ.if_test((cr[5], 1)):\n"
"            ...\n"
"      ```\n"
"   </TabItem>\n"
"   </Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Nested conditionals are not allowed. For example, the following code block will not work because it has an `if_test` inside another `if_test`:\n"
"   <Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Not valid\" label=\"Not valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Kondisional bersarang tidak dibenarkan. Sebagai contoh, blok kod berikut tidak akan berfungsi kerana ia mempunyai `if_test` di dalam `if_test` yang lain:\n"
"   <Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Not valid\" label=\"Tidak sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"           c1 = ClassicalRegister(1, \"c1\")\n"
"           c2 = ClassicalRegister(2, \"c2\")\n"
"           ...\n"
"           with circ.if_test((c1, 1)):\n"
"            with circ.if_test(c2, 1)):\n"
"             ...\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"           c1 = ClassicalRegister(1, \"c1\")\n"
"           c2 = ClassicalRegister(2, \"c2\")\n"
"           ...\n"
"           with circ.if_test((c1, 1)):\n"
"            with circ.if_test(c2, 1)):\n"
"             ...\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        cr = ClassicalRegister(2)\n"
"        ...\n"
"        with circuit.if_test((cr, 0b11)):\n"
"          ...\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        cr = ClassicalRegister(2)\n"
"        ...\n"
"        with circuit.if_test((cr, 0b11)):\n"
"          ...\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Having `reset` or measurements inside conditionals is not supported.\n"
msgstr "Mempunyai `reset` atau ukuran di dalam kondisional tidak disokong.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Arithmetic operations are not supported.\n"
msgstr "Operasi aritmetik tidak disokong.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "See the [OpenQASM 3 feature table](/guides/qasm-feature-table) to determine which OpenQASM 3 features are supported with Qiskit and Quantum Compute.\n"
msgstr "Lihat [jadual ciri OpenQASM 3](/guides/qasm-feature-table) untuk menentukan ciri OpenQASM 3 yang disokong dengan Qiskit dan Quantum Compute.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "When OpenQASM 3 (instead of `QuantumCircuit`) is used as the input format to pass circuits to IBM Quantum primitives, only instructions that can be loaded into Qiskit are supported. Classical operations, for example, are not supported because they cannot be loaded into Qiskit. See [Import an OpenQASM 3 program into Qiskit](/guides/interoperate-qiskit-qasm3#import-an-openqasm-3-program-into-qiskit) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Apabila OpenQASM 3 (bukan `QuantumCircuit`) digunakan sebagai format input untuk menghantar litar kepada primitif IBM Quantum, hanya arahan yang boleh dimuatkan ke dalam Qiskit yang disokong. Operasi klasikal, misalnya, tidak disokong kerana ia tidak boleh dimuatkan ke dalam Qiskit. Lihat [Import program OpenQASM 3 ke dalam Qiskit](/guides/interoperate-qiskit-qasm3#import-an-openqasm-3-program-into-qiskit) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `for`, `while`, and `switch` instructions are not supported.\n"
msgstr "Arahan `for`, `while`, dan `switch` tidak disokong.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use dynamic circuits with Estimator {#use-dynamic-circuits-with-estimator}"
msgstr "Gunakan litar dinamik dengan Estimator {#use-dynamic-circuits-with-estimator}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Since Estimator does not support dynamic circuits, you can use [Sampler](/guides/get-started-with-sampler) and build your own measurement circuits instead.\n"
msgstr "Oleh kerana Estimator tidak menyokong litar dinamik, anda boleh menggunakan [Sampler](/guides/get-started-with-sampler) dan membina litar ukuran sendiri.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To replicate Estimator's behavior, follow this process:\n"
msgstr "Untuk meniru tingkah laku Estimator, ikuti proses ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. Group the terms of all observables into a partition.  This can be done by using the [`PauliList` API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliList#group_qubit_wise_commuting), for example.\n"
"     <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      You can use the [`BitArray`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BitArray#expectation_values) primitive attribute to compute the expectation values of the provided observables.\n"
"     </Admonition>\n"
"2. Execute one basis change circuit per partition (whichever basis change needs to be done for each partition). See the Measurement bases addon utility [`measurement_bases` module](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/apidocs/qiskit_addon_utils.exp_vals.html#qiskit_addon_utils.exp_vals.get_measurement_bases) for more information. For more information, see the [documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/) for the Qiskit addon utilities package.\n"
"3. Add back together the results for each partition.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. Kumpulkan sebutan semua observable ke dalam partition. Ini boleh dilakukan dengan menggunakan [`PauliList` API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.PauliList#group_qubit_wise_commuting), sebagai contoh.\n"
"     <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      Anda boleh menggunakan atribut primitif [`BitArray`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.BitArray#expectation_values) untuk mengira nilai jangkaan bagi observable yang disediakan.\n"
"     </Admonition>\n"
"2. Laksanakan satu Circuit perubahan asas bagi setiap partition (perubahan asas mana-mana yang perlu dilakukan untuk setiap partition). Lihat [modul `measurement_bases`](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/apidocs/qiskit_addon_utils.exp_vals.html#qiskit_addon_utils.exp_vals.get_measurement_bases) utiliti tambahan Asas Pengukuran untuk maklumat lanjut. Untuk maklumat lanjut, lihat [dokumentasi](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-utils/) untuk pakej utiliti tambahan Qiskit.\n"
"3. Gabungkan semula hasil bagi setiap partition.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restrictions {#restrictions}"
msgstr "Sekatan {#restrictions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Review any [Feature compatibility table](/guides/estimator-options#options-compatibility-table) to understand restrictions when using dynamic circuits. Note that feature compatibility is not primitive-dependent.\n"
msgstr "Semak mana-mana [jadual Keserasian Ciri](/guides/estimator-options#options-compatibility-table) untuk memahami sekatan apabila menggunakan litar dinamik. Perhatikan bahawa keserasian ciri tidak bergantung pada primitif.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn how to implement accurate dynamic decoupling by using [stretch](/guides/stretch).\n"
"- Review the [classical feedforward and control flow](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow) guide.\n"
"- Use [circuit schedule visualization](/guides/qiskit-runtime-circuit-timing) to debug and optimize your dynamic circuits.\n"
"- Not all functions are compatible with dynamic circuits. Check the feature compatibility section for [Sampler](/guides/sampler-options#feature-compatibility) for details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- Ketahui cara melaksanakan decoupling dinamik yang tepat menggunakan [regangan](/guides/stretch).\n"
"- Semak panduan [suapan balik klasikal dan aliran kawalan](/guides/classical-feedforward-and-control-flow).\n"
"- Gunakan [visualisasi jadual litar](/guides/qiskit-runtime-circuit-timing) untuk menyahpepijat dan mengoptimumkan litar dinamik anda.\n"
"- Tidak semua fungsi serasi dengan litar dinamik. Semak bahagian keserasian ciri untuk [Sampler](/guides/sampler-options#feature-compatibility) untuk butiran.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
